' View index and evidence (baseline: merged integration d38231a).
' class-domain: Customer/Menu/Order; class-control: CLI/controller/staff;
' class-state: GameState ownership, snapshots/actions and relevant enums.
' sequence-1-game: ConsoleUI.run, CommandParser and TurnController's full loop;
' sequence-2-arrival: beginTurn, GameSetup.arrival and Host/Seating.seat;
' sequence-3-order: Waiter.takeOrder, Customer.chooseMeal, Order/Money, Chef.prepare;
' sequence-4-service: Customer.recover, Waiter.serve, eating step, Cashier.collect.
' Scenario: fixtures/stage-3/host-combo-happy-hour.{in,expected}; comparison:
' fixtures/stage-3/defeat.{in,expected}. No stage-3 tag is assumed to exist yet.
' C3: order 7, READY 9, SERVED 10, READY_TO_PAY 11, PAID 12 (1944 cents/84).
' Result: five payments, 7494 cents, satisfaction sum 419; alternative DEFEAT.
' OO responsibilities and omitted repeated interactions are annotated in each view.
' Render: see render.sh. Recheck scripts/replay.sh after design-changing fixes.
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172B3A
skinparam titleFontSize 23
skinparam titleFontColor #102A43
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 3
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 36
skinparam ArrowColor #334E68
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #E7EFF7
skinparam classBorderColor #486581
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF6D8
skinparam noteBorderColor #B8923B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E7EFF7
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #486581
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #829AB1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #EAF0F6
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #486581
skinparam sequenceReferenceBackgroundColor #E8F4ED
skinparam sequenceReferenceBorderColor #527D63
hide circle
hide empty members
<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  lifeLine {
    LineColor #486581
    LineThickness 2
  }
  arrow {
    LineThickness 2
  }
}
</style>
